@startuml
title OsteoPatch local patch review flow
actor Reviewer
participant "React / TypeScript UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI /v1" as API
database "Local records" as Store
collections "Verified images" as Images

Reviewer -> UI: Select an image
UI -> API: GET /v1/images/{image_id}
API -> Store: Check image allowlist and source/QC metadata
Store --> API: Image identity and quality fields
API --> UI: Image detail response
UI -> API: GET /v1/predictions/{prediction_id}
API -> Store: Read immutable prediction and model identity
Store --> API: Stored class scores and provenance
API --> UI: Prediction response
UI -> API: POST /v1/images/{image_id}/reviews
API -> Store: Append revision-aware review event
Store --> API: New review revision
API --> UI: Updated review state
UI -> Images: Request verified thumbnail or full image
Images --> UI: Allowlisted image bytes
note over UI,Store
Review changes are recorded separately from predictions.
They do not retrain the model.
end note
@enduml
